---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactLinks from '../components/ContactLinks.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';

const now = [
  { label: 'Reading', value: 'Seeing Like a State', note: 'Scott on how plans flatten what made them work.' },
  { label: 'Writing', value: 'Fewer, longer pieces', note: 'Cutting the thin ones rather than adding to them.' },
  { label: 'Working on', value: 'Brand strategy', note: 'For a company that should know better.' },
  { label: 'Stuck on', value: 'One Nina Simone record', note: 'Pastel Blues, side A, on repeat.' },
];

// Append a snapshot here each time the block above is actually updated, so
// this reads as a real changelog rather than an inferred/reconstructed one.
// Empty is the honest starting state -- nothing to archive before a first
// real update happens.
const nowHistory: Array<{ date: string; items: { label: string; value: string }[] }> = [];

const principles = [
  { no: '01', to: 1, title: 'The default is the decision.', body: 'Most choices are settled by whatever required no choice at all. Understand the defaults and you understand the behavior — everything after is theater.' },
  { no: '02', to: 2, title: 'Follow the money, then follow the attention.', body: 'Every nudge has a beneficiary. Asking who profits is not cynicism, it is just reading the incentives honestly before they read you.' },
  { no: '03', to: 3, title: 'Write to find out, not to look right.', body: 'I don’t write things I’ve concluded; I write to figure out what I think. If a piece doesn’t surprise me halfway through, it isn’t finished.' },
  { no: '04', to: 4, title: 'Build slowly, on purpose.', body: 'No growth hacks, no content treadmill. Fewer, better things — made at the speed they actually deserve.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About — Ilias Ennajmi"
  description="The person behind the essays: marketing strategy by day, writing about why people act and who profits on the side."
  active="about"
  ogType="profile"
  siteFx
>
<main id="main-content">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <header data-cursor-light style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:clamp(8rem,16vh,12rem) clamp(22px,6vw,64px) clamp(3.5rem,7vw,6rem);">
    <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;background:radial-gradient(90% 80% at 0% 18%, rgba(117,89,56,0.10), transparent 56%),radial-gradient(90% 80% at 100% 88%, rgba(117,89,56,0.08), transparent 56%),linear-gradient(180deg,var(--paper-hi) 0%,var(--paper-mid) 60%,var(--coal) 100%);"></div>
    <div style="position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;animation:cc-rise .9s ease both;">
      <div data-pll="0.10" data-watermark class="wm wm-right" style="top:8%;font-size:clamp(6rem,17vw,17rem);">A</div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ash);margin-bottom:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);">
        <span style="width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--ember);"></span>About — The person behind it
      </div>
      <h1 style="margin:0;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(3.2rem,10vw,7.6rem);line-height:0.92;letter-spacing:-0.015em;text-wrap:balance;">Who's speaking<span style="font-style:italic;color:var(--ember-vivid);">?</span></h1>
      <p style="font-family:var(--body);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.4vw,1.7rem);color:var(--bone);opacity:0.78;max-width:50ch;margin:1.8rem 0 0;line-height:1.5;text-wrap:pretty;">A marketing strategist who spends his off-hours reverse-engineering the same persuasion he does for a living — and writes the findings down before he can talk himself out of them.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- BIO -->
  <section style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem) clamp(22px,6vw,64px) clamp(4.5rem,9vw,7.5rem);">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.8rem);align-items:start;">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p style="font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.55rem,3.2vw,2.4rem);line-height:1.24;margin:0 0 1.8rem;letter-spacing:-0.005em;text-wrap:pretty;">I'm <span style="font-style:italic;">Ilias Ennajmi</span> — based in Casablanca, working wherever the interesting problems are.</p>
        <p style="font-family:var(--body);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.08rem,1.8vw,1.26rem);line-height:1.62;color:var(--tide);margin:0 0 1.4rem;max-width:60ch;text-wrap:pretty;">By day I work in marketing strategy: figuring out how to make people want things, and how to get out of the way once they do. It's a craft built on a slightly uncomfortable premise — that most decisions are made for us long before we think we're making them.</p>
        <p style="font-family:var(--body);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.08rem,1.8vw,1.26rem);line-height:1.62;color:var(--tide);margin:0 0 1.4rem;max-width:60ch;text-wrap:pretty;">That premise is also what I can't stop writing about. <span style="font-style:italic;">Ulysses</span> is where I take the slow road — psychology, behavior, philosophy, the question of why people act at all. <span style="font-style:italic;">Ilias</span> is the louder half — marketing and strategy, who profits when they do. Same machine, looked at from both ends.</p>
        <p style="font-family:var(--body);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.08rem,1.8vw,1.26rem);line-height:1.62;color:var(--tide);margin:0;max-width:60ch;text-wrap:pretty;">This site is where the two habits argue with each other in public. No newsletter funnel, no course, no five-step framework. Just the thinking, built slowly, on purpose.</p>
      </div>
      <span data-reveal style="display:block;margin-top:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.2rem);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.56rem;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ash);">Casablanca → wherever the work is</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NOW -->
  <section style="border-top:1px solid var(--coal-line);background:var(--coal-soft);">
    <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(4.5rem,9vw,7.5rem) clamp(22px,6vw,64px);">
      <div data-reveal style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;margin-bottom:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ash);">
        <span>Now — {SITE.nowUpdated}</span>
        <span class="cc-rule"></span>
        <span>What's current</span>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--coal-line);border:1px solid var(--coal-line);">
        {now.map((n) => (
          <div style="background:var(--coal-soft);padding:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;min-height:clamp(150px,16vw,200px);">
            <span style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.58rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ember);">{n.label}</span>
            <span style="font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.25rem,2.2vw,1.7rem);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.005em;">{n.value}</span>
            <span style="font-family:var(--body);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:0.98rem;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ash);margin-top:auto;">{n.note}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div data-reveal style="margin-top:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);">
        <details class="now-history">
          <summary style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ash);list-style:none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;">
            <span class="now-history-chev" aria-hidden="true" style="transition:transform .3s;">→</span>
            See how this has changed
          </summary>
          <div style="margin-top:1.2rem;padding-top:1.2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--coal-line);">
            {nowHistory.length > 0 ? (
              nowHistory.map((snap) => (
                <div style="margin-bottom:1.4rem;">
                  <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.58rem;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ash);margin-bottom:0.6rem;">{snap.date}</div>
                  {snap.items.map((it) => (
                    <div style="font-family:var(--body);font-size:0.98rem;color:var(--ash);"><span style="color:var(--bone);">{it.label}:</span> {it.value}</div>
                  ))}
                </div>
              ))
            ) : (
              <p style="margin:0;font-family:var(--body);font-style:italic;color:var(--ash);font-size:0.96rem;">Nothing archived yet — this is the first snapshot since launch. Real entries land here the next time the block above actually changes, not before.</p>
            )}
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRINCIPLES -->
  <section style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(4.5rem,9vw,7.5rem) clamp(22px,6vw,64px);">
    <div data-reveal style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;margin-bottom:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.4rem);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ash);">
      <span>How I think about it</span>
      <span class="cc-rule"></span>
      <span>Four working beliefs</span>
    </div>
    <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--coal-line);">
      {principles.map((pr) => (
        <div data-reveal style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:clamp(54px,7vw,90px) 1fr;gap:clamp(18px,4vw,56px);align-items:start;padding:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--coal-line);">
          <span class="cc-num" data-to={pr.to} style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.06em;color:var(--ember);padding-top:0.7rem;">{pr.no}</span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,3.1rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-0.01em;text-wrap:balance;">{pr.title}</div>
            <p style="font-family:var(--body);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.7vw,1.22rem);line-height:1.55;color:var(--tide);margin:1rem 0 0;max-width:58ch;text-wrap:pretty;">{pr.body}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT + COLOPHON -->
  <section style="border-top:1px solid var(--coal-line);">
    <div style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(4.5rem,9vw,7.5rem) clamp(22px,6vw,64px);">
      <h2 data-reveal style="font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.6rem);line-height:0.98;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 1.2rem;text-wrap:balance;">Say hello<span style="color:var(--ember-vivid);">.</span></h2>
      <p data-reveal style="font-family:var(--body);font-weight:400;font-style:italic;color:var(--ash);font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2vw,1.4rem);margin:0 0 clamp(2.4rem,5vw,3.5rem);">For work, arguments, or book recommendations.</p>
      <div data-reveal style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,56px);margin-bottom:clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.6rem);">
        <ContactLinks />
      </div>
      <p data-reveal style="font-family:var(--body);font-weight:300;font-style:italic;color:var(--ash);font-size:clamp(0.95rem,1.6vw,1.1rem);max-width:52ch;margin:0 0 clamp(3.5rem,7vw,5.5rem);line-height:1.5;">Also open to strategy consulting, if the incentives line up. <a href="mailto:hello@iliasennajmi.com?subject=Consulting%20inquiry" class="charge" style="color:var(--ember);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--coal-line);text-underline-offset:3px;">Say so in the subject line</a> and skip the deck — that's not a funnel, just an inbox.</p>
      <div data-reveal style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:clamp(10px,2vw,20px);align-items:baseline;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ash);">
        <a href="/colophon/" class="charge" style="color:inherit;transition:color .25s;">Colophon →</a>
        <span style="width:14px;height:1px;background:var(--coal-line);align-self:center;"></span>
        <span>Set in Fraunces, EB&nbsp;Garamond &amp; Space&nbsp;Grotesk</span>
        <span style="width:3px;height:3px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ember);align-self:center;"></span>
        <span>Built slowly, on purpose</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  a.charge[href="/colophon/"]:hover { color: var(--ember); }
  .now-history summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .now-history[open] .now-history-chev { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .now-history summary:hover { color: var(--bone); }
</style>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', () => {
    window.pageBoot({ strand: null, progress: 'page' });
  });
</script>
